## Security Coverage Summary

| Attack | Protection | Layer |
|---|---|---|
| XSS | CSP + `sanitizeHTML()` + `stripTags()` | Transport + App |
| Clickjacking | `X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN` + JS frame-busting | Transport + App |
| CSRF | CSRF tokens injected into forms | App |
| Brute Force | 2 req/s on auth pages + client rate limiter | Nginx + App |
| DDoS/Flood | 10 req/s general + 50 conn/IP + request size limit | Nginx |
| Open Redirect | `safeRedirect()` + URL validation | App |
| Dir Traversal | `/data/`, `/docs/`, `/scripts/`, dotfiles blocked | Nginx |
| Info Disclosure | `server_tokens off`, sensitive files blocked | Nginx |
| Container Escape | Read-only FS, dropped caps, non-root, no-new-privileges | Docker |
| Resource Exhaustion | 1 CPU, 256MB RAM limits | Docker |
| MIME Sniffing | `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` | Transport |

