## How to Use

### Start with Docker
```bash
# Windows
scripts\manage.bat start

# Linux/macOS
./scripts/manage.sh start

# → http://localhost:8080
```

### Verify Security
```bash
# Check security headers
scripts/manage.sh health

# Test blocked paths (should return 403)
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" http://localhost:8080/data/magazines.json
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" http://localhost:8080/.git/config
```
